  "description": "Server-side services for Codeer.LowCode.Blazor apps. Includes AI document analysis (Azure Document Intelligence + Azure OpenAI), mail sending (SMTP / Microsoft Graph / SendGrid / Gmail), file storage (file system / Azure Blob / S3), external logins (Entra ID / Google / AWS Cognito / OIDC), TOTP two-factor authentication, audit log (who / when / from where / what / result, per Web API, to database and JSON Lines files), and ASP.NET Core helpers (hot reload, ETag file responses).",
