  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SemanticSearchService: AI chat can search by keywords across the semantic search text. The index is built after each save from the saved records by Interceptor (register it with AddInterceptor last; ConditionInterceptor is an obsolete alias). ApplyAsync(datas) removed; bulk imports leave the index empty, call ReindexMissing() afterwards (it embeds existing text as is and builds text only where missing). Reindex requires write permission on the field and writes only the index columns. Indexing failures roll back the save and are recorded as failures in the audit log. LoggerFactory for warnings. Attachment contents are indexed (FileStorages; FileTextExtractors maps extensions to IFileTextExtractor implementations: PDF / Word / PowerPoint / Excel / text / HTML by default). Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor 1.3.50 and Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.DbAccess 0.2.1.",
